19f587c367c50cd984ef672a18184c15c5fe242","body":[{"type":"text","value":"12.原子钟对提升导航定位、深空探测、电力系统授时等技术具有重要意义，如图所示为某 J\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9dbdf2b1d9581ee250d890e69435328e5ec7c27ebc30e4d440863a11c34f8743.png","width":373,"height":268,"width_mm":43.68,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n原子钟工作原子的四能级体系。首先，工作原子吸收波长为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"text","value":"o的光子a，从基态能级Ⅰ跃迁至激发态能级Ⅱ。然后，工作原子 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"text","value":"1 2自发辐射出波长为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"text","value":"₁的光子，跃迁到“钟跃迁”的上能级2，并 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"text","value":"0 22 钟激光在一定条件下跃迁到“钟跃迁”的下能级1，辐射出波长为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"text","value":"2 1的光子，实现受激辐射，发出钟激光。最后，工作原子从下能 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"text","value":"3级1回到基态，同时辐射出波长为₃的光子。则（）\n\n原卷公共参数：本卷中无特殊说明，重力加速度g均取10m/s²。\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 某“振荡器”产生的电磁场能使工作原子从能级1跃迁到能级2，则“振荡器”的振荡频率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac { c } { \\lambda _ { 2 } }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 该原子钟产生的钟激光的波长 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda_{2} = \\lambda_{0} - \\lambda_{1} - \\lambda_{3}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 光子a的动量一定比钟激光的动量大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 钟激光可以让某金属材料发生光电效应，光子a一定也可以"}]],"answer":{"status":"not_ingested","key":null,"body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q13","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--jinliqu-shierxiao-2503","source_question_id":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学"],"answer_status":"not_ingested","fingerprint":"ebad0276d1c3c3edd5fab97f97e52e3dacb0d739436e94142f1d163ce6f94c6d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 在冰雕展上有一块边长为2 m的立方体冰块，冰块内上下底面中心连线为 "},{"type":"math","value":"OO'"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n在立方体底面内安装了一盏可视为圆形平面的面光源灯，面光源灯半径为0.5 m，圆心在 "},{"type":"math","value":"O'"},{"type":"text","value":" 处。\n光源为单色光源，冰块的折射率取 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，不考虑二次反射。\n由于全反射，在立方体冰面上有些位置没有光射出。下列四幅图表示对应的表面有光射出的情况，\n阴影部分表示有光射出的部分，下列正确的是（ ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/06a845f45ad0c80d30978bcccb92446ed43f95a63021b76bcffc0eceb8b4523e.png","width":326,"height":329,"width_mm":38.22,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q13-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2fccc9cd73ac115236dac1c17eea836971f19b202b81257b4cbd6ecfc59194fe.png","width":292,"height":284,"width_mm":34.23,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q13-row2"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a217307e7e9a3fea6b270a5eb95509605c01fd66c9f039c1643c286fdee20c20.png","width":293,"height":284,"width_mm":34.44,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q13-row2"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"figure","src":"images/4e14c1f0742979b900eb967ba475af281f8515109f539011951370d6fcd444b1.png","width":290,"height":284,"width_mm":34.02,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q13-row2"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"figure","src":"images/78f3f8688ae5c9fbd57c581c8c5398cd8047c1eccb7bb500847e951c4c355995.png","width":290,"height":279,"width_mm":34.02,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q13-row2"}]],"answer":{"status":"not_ingested","key":null,"body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q14","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--jinliqu-shierxiao-2503","source_question_id":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","电学","光学"],"answer_status":"not_ingested","fingerprint":"8cd00a6bb61743fccce2e8fe00520a096769ab3965b89c95767220bedda71c25","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题（Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅲ三题共14分）\n\n14-Ⅰ.（7分）如图为一种利用气垫导轨“验证机械能守恒定律”的实验装置，主要实验步骤如下：\na. 将气垫导轨放在水平桌面上，将导轨调至水平。\nb. 在导轨上间隔一定距离设置两个光电门1和2。\nc. 用天平测出滑块和遮光条的质量"},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":"。\nd. 在导轨的单脚螺丝下垫上一定厚度的垫片，让滑块从最高处由静止开始下滑，用数字计时器测出滑块经过光电门1和2时遮光条的遮光时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_1"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"t_2"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/deb95e0add14ee0bd778e102bc7c02d5693af1d88225e9808f5a30125b640401.png","width":648,"height":279,"width_mm":76.02,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\ne. 取下垫片，用游标卡尺测量所用垫片的厚度"},{"type":"math","value":"h"},{"type":"text","value":"和遮光条的宽度"},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":"。\nf. 用钢卷尺测量单脚螺丝到双脚螺丝连线的距离"},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":"及两光电门之间的距离"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"。\ng. ……\n请回答下列问题：\n（1）（多选）关于该实验，以下说法不正确的是（ ）。A. 遮光条宽度适当小些；B. 滑块和遮光条的质量"},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":"可以不要测量；C. 滑块和遮光条的质量"},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":"轻一点可以减小误差；D. 实验时需要倾斜导轨以平衡摩擦力。\n（2）该同学用游标卡尺测量垫片的厚度如图所示，则垫片的厚度"},{"type":"math","value":"h="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）mm。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a96ed8a5f599c94408e591f40be7a2d3160af5b0d50cda5d4d292a1a8c93884d.png","width":355,"height":196,"width_mm":41.58,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）若要得出机械能守恒定律的结论，以上测得的物理量应该满足的关系式为（填空）。\n（4）（多选）多次实验发现动能的增加量总是略小于重力势能的减小量，其原因可能是（ ）。A. 遮光条宽度"},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":"的测量值偏小；B. 导轨没有调水平，导轨左端略低于右端；C. 空气阻力的影响；D. 两光电门之间的距离"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"的测量值偏小。\n\n14-Ⅱ.（5分）小刘同学在家找到一个老旧的白炽灯泡，他对这个灯泡进行研究，先用欧姆表"},{"type":"math","value":"\\times10"},{"type":"text","value":"挡进行测量，正确操作后发现指针如图甲所示。小刘同学为了更准确地测量灯泡的电阻，找到了下列器材：\nA. 量程为3 V的电压表，内阻约为"},{"type":"math","value":"3\\,\\mathrm{k}\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"；B. 量程为10 mA的电流表，内阻为"},{"type":"math","value":"6\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"；C. 滑动变阻器"},{"type":"math","value":"R_1"},{"type":"text","value":"（0～"},{"type":"math","value":"10\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"）；D. 滑动变阻器"},{"type":"math","value":"R_2"},{"type":"text","value":"（0～"},{"type":"math","value":"100\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"）；E. 电阻箱"},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":"（"},{"type":"math","value":"999.9\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"）；F. 电源3 V；开关及导线若干。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/118af7efe9acdc4996cc2767a8d80f60f419edb021393e25650ee224bf4219b4.png","width":538,"height":347,"width_mm":63.21,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n（1）小刘同学发现电流表的量程太小，想改装成量程为40 mA的电流表，则电流表与电阻箱（填空）（填并联或串联），阻值为（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n（2）若要求电压从0开始测量，滑动变阻器选（填空）（填器材前的字母）。\n（3）根据所选器材，把实物连接图乙补充完整。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c5dce9dc3267f5928d476fe22689ca62989772de92c7ca96149b0004112dbcb1.png","width":302,"height":425,"width_mm":35.49,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n（4）根据所测量的数据，画出"},{"type":"math","value":"I-U"},{"type":"text","value":"图线如图丙所示，若已知图线的斜率为"},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":"，则灯泡的电阻为（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/42e3f74f09848c84f05c75339c7a2cb9c26756debad2a64a8dd0912f723124bd.png","width":305,"height":375,"width_mm":35.7,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2503-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丙\n\n14-Ⅲ.（2分）（1）以下实验采用的研究方法是控制变量法的有（ ）。A. 探究小车速度随时间变化的规律；B. 探究弹簧弹力与形变量的关系；C. 探究变压器线圈两端的电压与匝数的关系；D. 用双缝干涉测量光的波长。\n（2）小陈同学在做“探究变压器线圈两端的电压与匝数的关系”实验时，测得的实验数据如表所示。请根据实验数据判断，该次实验时原线圈的匝数比副线圈的匝数（填空）（填“多”“少”“相等”或“无法判断”）。\n"},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"math","value":"\\quad"},{"type":"text","value":"次数"}],[{"type":"text","value":"1"}],[{"type":"text","value":"2"}],[{"type":"text","value":"3"}],[{"type":"text","value":"4"}]],[[{"type":"math","value":"U_1"},{"type":"text","value":"/V"}],[{"type":"text","value":"4.90"}],[{"type":"text","value":"6.00"}],[{"type":"text","value":"7.50"}],[{"type":"text","value":"10.06"}]],[[{"type":"math","value":"U_2"},{"type":"text","value":"/V"}],[{"type":"text","value":"2.40"}],[{"type":"text","value":"2.92"}],[{"type":"text","value":"3.70"}],[{"type":"text","value":"4.97"}]]]},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：本卷中无特殊说明，重力加速度g均取10m/s²。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"st